{
  "name": "Shadow Shot",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You weave illusion magic into your projectile, causing it to occlude your foe's vision with shadows. The creature hit by the projectile takes D6 x your Proficiency extra psychic damage, and it must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw or be unable to see anything farther than 5 feet away for 1 minute. The target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success.</p>",
